  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GanzAfrica partners with African governments to help them use data and evidence in the implementation of agricultural policies and programs. This grant will enable GanzAfrica to partner with governments in Kenya and Rwanda to support the implementation of specific agricultural policies with data and evidence. (Strategy: Evidence-Informed Policymaking)</narrative>
